{"id":"31939e9d65c515ab","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-finite-use-preservation.md","title":"Preservation of a Finite Oracle Computation","display":"df-finite-use-preservation — Preservation of a Finite Oracle Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-finite-use-preservation","aliases":["68-df-finite-use-preservation","68-df-sacks-preservation-strategy"],"display":"df-finite-use-preservation — Preservation of a Finite Oracle Computation","depends_on":["[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]"],"source_location":"§12 p.43 / PDF52 and §15.5 p.57 / PDF66; local finite-use interface","verification_status":"local-interface-pending-sacks-mechanism","source_proof_status":"local-finite-run-argument-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"renamed_from":"68-df-sacks-preservation-strategy","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-finite-use-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-finite-use-preservation</span><span>68-df-sacks-preservation-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-use-preservation — Preservation of a Finite Oracle Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12 p.43 / PDF52 and §15.5 p.57 / PDF66; local finite-use interface"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-pending-sacks-mechanism"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-finite-run-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"renamed_from","html":"68-df-sacks-preservation-strategy"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,s_0,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,s_0,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A=(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\vec A=(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。oracle 程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e^O\">\\(P_e^O\\)</span>、合法索引集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prog}^O\">\\(\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\)</span>、配置序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^A\">\\(C^A\\)</span>、寄存器赋值空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(e,A,x,t)\">\\(Q(e,A,x,t)\\)</span> 为前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 步实际查询的自然数集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Preserve}\">\\(\\mathrm{Preserve}\\)</span> 依赖整个阶段 oracle 序列。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_s(e,A,x),u_s(e,A,x)\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(h_s(e,A,x),u_s(e,A,x)\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是以下新增的有界停机时刻和查询界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0\">\\(\\pi_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a> 的配置第一投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_s=s+1\">\\(h_s=s+1\\)</span> 是未在给定步数内停机的标记；有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span> 使查询界在没有查询时也有定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(e,A,x,t):=\\{z\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists v&lt;t\\;\\exists q,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n(C^A(P_e^O,x,v)=(q,\\rho)\\land (q,(3,i,j))\\in P_e^O\\land z=\\rho(i))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(e,A,x,t):=\\{z\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists v&lt;t\\;\\exists q,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n(C^A(P_e^O,x,v)=(q,\\rho)\\land (q,(3,i,j))\\in P_e^O\\land z=\\rho(i))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Preserve}(e,x,s_0,\\vec A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\ne\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t\\le s_0\\;\\exists u,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\Bigl(C^{A_{s_0}}(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\n\\land Q(e,A_{s_0},x,t)\\subseteq u\n\\land\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;(A_s\\cap u=A_{s_0}\\cap u)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Preserve}(e,x,s_0,\\vec A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\ne\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t\\le s_0\\;\\exists u,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\Bigl(C^{A_{s_0}}(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\n\\land Q(e,A_{s_0},x,t)\\subseteq u\n\\land\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;(A_s\\cap u=A_{s_0}\\cap u)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_s(e,A,x):=\\min\\left(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t\\le s\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\pi_0(C^A(P_e^O,x,t))\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\}\\cup\\{s+1\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_s(e,A,x):=\\min\\left(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t\\le s\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\pi_0(C^A(P_e^O,x,t))\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\}\\cup\\{s+1\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u_s(e,A,x):=\\begin{cases}\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{z+1:z\\in Q(e,A,x,h_s(e,A,x))\\}\\bigr)&amp;h_s(e,A,x)\\le s,\\\\0&amp;h_s(e,A,x)=s+1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u_s(e,A,x):=\\begin{cases}\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{z+1:z\\in Q(e,A,x,h_s(e,A,x))\\}\\bigr)&amp;h_s(e,A,x)\\le s,\\\\0&amp;h_s(e,A,x)=s+1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_s(e,A,x)\\le s\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;Q(e,A,x,h_s(e,A,x))\\subseteq u_s(e,A,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_s(e,A,x)\\le s\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;Q(e,A,x,h_s(e,A,x))\\subseteq u_s(e,A,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一个具体停机计算及其实际有限查询范围被永久保持的接口。每步至多一次查询，Q 有限，故能取自然数上界 u。若 Preserve 成立，按运行步数归纳，各后续 A_s 上的同一运行与 A_{s0} 完全相同，输出保持；若阶段 oracle 逐点收敛于 A，最终 oracle A 上也有此计算。</p>\n<p>旧式没有把 u 与实际计算的查询联系起来，也隐藏 A_s 序列；现在均显式化。原书 §12 末 p.43/PDF52 给有限依赖，§15.5 p.57/PDF66 用限制保护计算；本文件据此改名为有限查询保持接口；它没有定义完整 Sacks 策略，也不以策略存在性为隐含前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,x,s_0,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\vec A=(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}$。oracle 程序 $P_e^O$、合法索引集 $\\mathrm{Prog}^O$、配置序列 $C^A$、寄存器赋值空间 $\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$Q(e,A,x,t)$ 为前 $t$ 步实际查询的自然数集合，$\\mathrm{Preserve}$ 依赖整个阶段 oracle 序列。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb N$；$h_s(e,A,x),u_s(e,A,x)\\in\\mathbb N$ 是以下新增的有界停机时刻和查询界。$\\pi_0$ 取 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] 的配置第一投影。$h_s=s+1$ 是未在给定步数内停机的标记；有限集合 $\\{0\\}$ 使查询界在没有查询时也有定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,s_0,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec A=(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"P_e^O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prog}^O","display":false},{"tex":"C^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"Q(e,A,x,t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Preserve}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h_s(e,A,x),u_s(e,A,x)\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0","display":false},{"tex":"h_s=s+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q(e,A,x,t):=\\{z\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists v<t\\;\\exists q,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n(C^A(P_e^O,x,v)=(q,\\rho)\\land (q,(3,i,j))\\in P_e^O\\land z=\\rho(i))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Preserve}(e,x,s_0,\\vec A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\ne\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t\\le s_0\\;\\exists u,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\Bigl(C^{A_{s_0}}(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\n\\land Q(e,A_{s_0},x,t)\\subseteq u\n\\land\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;(A_s\\cap u=A_{s_0}\\cap u)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"h_s(e,A,x):=\\min\\left(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t\\le s\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\pi_0(C^A(P_e^O,x,t))\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\}\\cup\\{s+1\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"u_s(e,A,x):=\\begin{cases}\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{z+1:z\\in Q(e,A,x,h_s(e,A,x))\\}\\bigr)&h_s(e,A,x)\\le s,\\\\0&h_s(e,A,x)=s+1.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"h_s(e,A,x)\\le s\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;Q(e,A,x,h_s(e,A,x))\\subseteq u_s(e,A,x).","display":true}],"bytes":3058,"backlinks":[{"id":"f056ea86f9505c97","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,i,x\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,1\\}$。有限序列及连接见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]，$\\Phi_{e,s}^{D}$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]，查询界 $u_s(e,D,x)$ 见 [[68-df-finite-use-preservation]]，$\\chi_D$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-use-preservation|df-finite-use-preservation — Preservation of a Finite Oracle Computation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-use-preservation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[68-df-minimal-degree-tree]] 保留树验收定义；[[68-prop-minimal-degree-tree-characterization]] 只展开该定义，不构造见证。[[68-df-priority-true-path]] 按其实际内容归为阶段路径和真路径条件的定义，不作为方法存在性定理；[[68-df-fixed-marker-coding]] 与 [[68-df-finite-use-preservation]] 只提供各自明示的局部接口，不宣称完整 Sacks 策略。"}],"outgoing":["124259d2584af1b6","89e092f6450e5227"]}